name: sim.setFloatProperty
description: Sets a float property (double)
luaSynopsis: sim.setFloatProperty(int target, string propertyName, float propertyState, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: sim.setFloatProperty(int target, string propertyName, float propertyState, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. propertyState: property value
4. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
